{
  "title": "General Aamal in Shaban",
  "data": "Each day in Sha'ban, recite 70 times:\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللّٰهَ وَ اَسْاَلُهُ التَّوْبَةَ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHA WA AS-ALUHUT TAWBAH\nI implore for the forgiveness of Allah and I pray to Him for approval of my repentance.\nAlso recite 70 times each day in Sha'ban:\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللّٰهَ الَّذِيْ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ الرَّحْمٰنُ الرَّحِيْمُ الْحَيُّ الْقَيُّوْمُ وَ اَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHAL LAZEE LAA ILAAHA ILLAA HUWAR RAHMAANUR RAHEEMUL HAYYUL QAYYOOMU WA ATOOBU ILAYH\nI implore for the forgiveness of Allah; there is no god save Him, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful, the Ever-living, the Self-subsisting, and to Him I turn repentant.\nGive alms this month, even if it is only half a date.\nThroughout the month, repeat 1,000 times:\nلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَ لَا نَعْبُدُ اِلَّاۤ اِيَّاهُ مُخْلِصِيْنَ لَهُ الدِّيْنَ وَ لَوْ كَرِهَ الْمُشْرِكُوْنَ\nLAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WA LAA NA'BUDU ILLAA IYYAAHU MUKHLISEENA LAHUD DEENA WA LAW KARIHAL MUSHRIKOON\nThere is no god save Allah, and we worship none save Him, being sincere to Him in obedience, though the polytheists be averse."
}
